</div>
<div class="cbx-panel"><h4>The period</h4><div class="dd-range"><div class="dd-pt"><small>From</small><b>##range_from##</b></div><div class="dd-line"></div><div class="dd-pt"><small>To</small><b>##range_to##</b></div></div><div class="dd-tag">##range_note##</div></div><div class="cbx-panel"><h4>Countdown clock: calendar time between the dates</h4><div class="dd-clock"><div class="dd-unit"><b>##cd_y##</b><span>##cd_yl##</span></div><div class="dd-unit"><b>##cd_m##</b><span>##cd_ml##</span></div><div class="dd-unit"><b>##cd_d##</b><span>##cd_dl##</span></div></div></div><div class="cbx-panel"><h4>Working and non-working days, and how many of each weekday</h4>##wd_bars##</div>
